टिप्पणी_गर Collatz Conjecture (3N + 1) with Max Step Limiter
मान n = 15
मान steps = 0
मान max_steps = 100

छाप("Starting Collatz Sequence...")

जबसम्म (n != 1) {
    मान steps = steps जोड 1
    यदि_हो (steps > max_steps) {
        छाप("Max steps reached! Breaking.")
        रोक
    }
    
    यदि_हो (n % 2 == 0) {
        मान n = n / 2
    }
    नत्र {
        मान n = (3 * n) जोड 1
    }
}
छाप("Total Steps Taken:")
छाप(steps)
